instruction: |
  TinyRustLM.MiRust.com 1.8.3 is a prepared source release only. It has no C1 content commit, package-only C2, C3 deployment metadata, deployment, HTTPS readback, or receipt yet; do not describe local edits, tests, or generated previews as publication. Finish the bounded source-copy retirement and public-artifact gates, commit one coherent C1 source revision, generate the exact package manifest from C1, commit only that manifest as C2, and generate C3 deployment metadata and an initially absent 1.8.3 stage from immutable C2. Prove local/remote equality before considering an authorized deployment. Any deployment must prove every manifest byte plus GET and HEAD terminal 410 behavior for every retired route variant and must create a new append-only receipt.

