standing_authority: |
  Maintain exactly one canonical writable TinyRustLM.com source checkout. Fail closed before editing, building, testing, committing, releasing, or deploying if its identity is ambiguous or a second writable checkout exists. Preserve deployment manifests and receipts as binary Git artifacts. Maintain one clean-slate six-member SLM2 path, keep optional TinyRustLM.MemoryEndpoints outside the default three-package transaction, preserve both authorized MemoryEndpoints.com uses, and never claim qualified models, live peers, live memory rounds, or campaign progress from source or configuration alone.

terminal_history: TinyRustLM.MiRust.com 1.8.2, 1.8.1, 1.8.0, and 1.7.0 publication evidence remains preserved in file-handoff.uai and immutable receipts.
